    {
      "name": "lifted_pointwise",
      "description": "The network lifted pointwise onto 4 cells by an operator_compose with a deposition model (EarthSciIntegrator's pointwise_chemistry fixture plus R3 `2 NO2 -> NO2 + 1.5 NO`). The lift indexes every species reference per cell and changes nothing else, so the reaction system's contribution has exactly the scalar form. Only that contribution is compared: the equation's left-hand side and `faq` wrapper carry the lift's own range spelling, which this corpus does not pin.",
